        "@value": "Employment periods preceding a break in service of more than seven years must be counted if either condition is met: (i) the break was occasioned by fulfillment of a USERRA-covered service obligation; OR (ii) a written agreement exists concerning the employer's intention to rehire the employee after the break.",
